{"id": 18951, "title": "This is my boyfriend", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "this-is-my-boyfriend", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/18951_this-is-my-boyfriend.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我有男朋友了，他的名字叫张阳。他不胖也不瘦，个子很高，喜欢运动。我们认识三年半了。张阳是我哥哥的同学，但是哥哥对他不满意，因为他没有工作。张阳有一个妹妹，还是个中学生，我很喜欢这个女孩，非常聪明可爱。张阳的妈妈是护士，他的爸爸在一个小公司工作，我还没见过他们。这就是我的男朋友和他的家人，你觉得怎么样？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我有男朋友了，他的名字叫張陽。他不胖也不瘦，個子很高，喜歡運動。我們認識三年半了。張陽是我哥哥的同學，但是哥哥對他不滿意，因為他沒有工作。張陽有一個妹妹，還是個中學生，我很喜歡這個女孩，非常聰明可愛。張陽的媽媽是護士，他的爸爸在一個小公司工作，我還沒見過他們。這就是我的男朋友和他的家人，你覺得怎麼樣？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ yǒu nán péng you le， tā de míng zi jiào Zhāng Yáng。 tā bù pàng yě bù shòu， gè zi hěn gāo， xǐ huan yùn dòng。 wǒ men rèn shi sān nián bàn le。 Zhāng Yáng shì wǒ gē ge de tóng xué， dàn shì gē ge duì tā bù mǎn yì， yīn wèi tā méi yǒu gōng zuò。 Zhāng Yáng yǒu yī gè mèi mei， hái shì gè zhōng xué shēng， wǒ hěn xǐ huan zhè gè nǚ hái， fēi cháng cōng míng kě ài。 Zhāng Yáng de mā ma shì hù shi， tā de bà ba zài yī gè xiǎo gōng sī gōng zuò， wǒ hái méi jiàn guo tā men。 zhè jiù shì wǒ de nán péng you hé tā de jiā rén， nǐ jué de zěn me yàng？"], "english_paragraphs": ["I have a boyfriend, his name is Zhang Yang. He is neither fat nor thin, very tall and likes sports. We have known each other for three and a half years. Zhang Yang is my brother's classmate, but my brother is not satisfied with him because he has no job. Zhang Yang has a sister who is a middle school student. I like this girl very much. She is very smart and cute. Zhang Yang’s mother is a nurse and his father works in a small company. I haven’t met them yet. This is my boyfriend and his family, what do you think?"], "english_full": "I have a boyfriend, his name is Zhang Yang. He is neither fat nor thin, very tall and likes sports. We have known each other for three and a half years. Zhang Yang is my brother's classmate, but my brother is not satisfied with him because he has no job. Zhang Yang has a sister who is a middle school student. I like this girl 